# No Cursor git attribution

Never add any of the following to commit messages, PR bodies, or code comments:

- `Co-authored-by: Cursor`
- `Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>`
- `Made-with: Cursor`
- Any other Cursor / cursoragent attribution trailer

Write commit messages and PR descriptions with human authorship only.
